GPT4_answer:
```mathematica
a[n_] := a[n] = a[n - 1] + Sum[Binomial[n - 1, k] a[k] a[n - 1 - k], {k, 0, n - 1}];
a[0] = 1;
Table[a[n], {n, 0, 9}]
```

